    "description": {
      "value": "A glimmering missive sparkles as you compose it. When activated, it explodes, disintegrating into a shower of multicolored motes in a 10-foot burst from a corner of the missive's space. Creatures in the area are covered in sparkling dust that remains luminous for 1 hour. Visible creatures can't be concealed while covered by the luminous dust; any invisible creatures are concealed while covered in the luminous dust, rather than being undetected.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components envision, Interact"
